(7461554, 1182943, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by postoakinversion:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice colors, good focus and sharpness. The main problem here is the lighting. The subjects are shadowed and underexposed. It''s a good photo, but some additional light (from a fill flash or maybe a reflector) could''ve made it a lot better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I photographed the scene exactly as I saw it, this is not a prepared shot :)</td>', 'Originally posted by postoakinversion: Nice colors, good focus and sharpness. The main problem here is the lighting. The subjects are shadowed and underexposed. It''s a good photo, but some additional light (from a fill flash or maybe a reflector) could''ve made it a lot better.   I photographed the scene exactly as I saw it, this is not a prepared shot :)', '2016-06-24 05:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
