(7461575, 1182946, 109227, '<td valign="top">Priceless!  This reminds me of an image I have of my grandson carrying his beloved rabbit; same story.  Eventually his Mother had to find another just in case it got left somewhere (happened).  He would not go to sleep without it.  He is now eight years and doesn''t carry it around but still has it.  I miss those years.  Thanks and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Priceless!  This reminds me of an image I have of my grandson carrying his beloved rabbit; same story.  Eventually his Mother had to find another just in case it got left somewhere (happened).  He would not go to sleep without it.  He is now eight years and doesn''t carry it around but still has it.  I miss those years.  Thanks and congrats on the ribbon.', '2016-06-24 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
