(7461577, 1182941, 109227, '<td valign="top">This just made me smile every time I viewed it during voting; even my hubby laughed, as it reminded us both of images from long ago of him and his brother (my hubby the one with the bandage).  Just priceless and I really wanted to see it with a ribbon.  Congrats on the HM.</td>', 'This just made me smile every time I viewed it during voting; even my hubby laughed, as it reminded us both of images from long ago of him and his brother (my hubby the one with the bandage).  Just priceless and I really wanted to see it with a ribbon.  Congrats on the HM.', '2016-06-24 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7461578, 1182993, 109227, '<td valign="top">Animals are such a comfort; unconditional love and companionship.  The lighting is wonderful and I think you look good, especially after what you have been through.  Congrats on the HM.</td>', 'Animals are such a comfort; unconditional love and companionship.  The lighting is wonderful and I think you look good, especially after what you have been through.  Congrats on the HM.', '2016-06-24 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 0),
