(7461763, 1182993, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s this stuff you can get in a diffuser by a company called Feliway - they have a version that helps cats stop scratching things (and marking things, if they''re doing that, too.)  I was using it for Sir Thomas, who''d taken to marking a bit now and then and am now stuck with four refills of the stuff and the diffuser with no more use for it (Sir Thomas dropped dead on Thursday).  I did notice he had quit scratching the furniture when I was using it, too.  You might want to look into it.</td>', 'There''s this stuff you can get in a diffuser by a company called Feliway - they have a version that helps cats stop scratching things (and marking things, if they''re doing that, too.)  I was using it for Sir Thomas, who''d taken to marking a bit now and then and am now stuck with four refills of the stuff and the diffuser with no more use for it (Sir Thomas dropped dead on Thursday).  I did notice he had quit scratching the furniture when I was using it, too.  You might want to look into it.', '2016-06-26 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
